<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Vegas Strip AFK Farming Macro (Money &amp; XP) – The Crew Motorfest

This macro is used to farm money and XP AFK on the Vegas Strip race using the RUF CTR-3 Drag Edition (fully upgraded).

Important:
Start the macro only after completing the race once.
You should activate the macro on the end results screen (the screen where the race results and rewards are shown).

Setup:

Game: The Crew Motorfest

Race: Vegas Strip

Car: RUF CTR-3 Drag Edition

Upgrades: Fully upgraded




How to use:

Start the Vegas Strip race.

Complete the race manually once.

When you reach the results/end screen (where the rewards and times are displayed), start the macro.

The macro will automatically restart the race and repeat it, allowing you to farm money and XP while AFK.</Description>
    <Comment>Hello, idk what to write here but luv yall :3</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
